title: Flat-docs pivot — drop manifest concept, fix .atelier/ listing bug
summary: 'Owner pushed back on the manifest-centric model after testing the just-shipped doc-management UI: "all .atelier files should behave the same... projects probably shouldn''t have a base atelier file." Plus a real bug — the hidden .atelier/ metadata directory was surfacing in the docs list. Pivot landed as commit c479f61. Mostly DELETION: isManifestDoc retired, ^manifest-doc-protected gate retired, DocumentEntry simplified to {path, kind?}, three-group sidebar (DOCUMENT/SLIDES/OTHER DOCS) collapsed to one flat DOCS group, compose-* helpers gained required docPath param, drag-drop retargets to <slug>.atelier, listDocs adds isFile() filter. Plus net-new: + add slide carousel button (v1 scope: create new only), canvas empty state.'
